 Windows 7 Enhanced edition
 Enhanced by : Leon Khoo
 Based on    : "Plasma SVG Win7 Theme" by Blackcrack / Blackysgate.de

 The original theme is the work of the original author. This enhanced
 edition is based on it but REPLACES a number of icons with newly drawn
 artwork (for example the archive/compressed-file mimetypes and the
 org.kde.dolphin and user-desktop icons); those replacements are the work
 of Leon Khoo, while the remaining icons keep the original author's
 copyright. The replaced originals are kept in _backup/. The edition also
 adds touched-up metadata and a user-level install script.

 Third-party artwork inside the icon theme keeps its own copyright, e.g.
 weather applet icons from deviantart.com/jackseller and various vendor /
 application logos.

